From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 15:09:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] loader: redirect ARM64EC EntryPoint via arm64ec_redirect_ptr
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ARM64EC PE binaries (ucrtbase, kernel32, kernelbase) point
AddressOfEntryPoint at the .hexpthk section — the x86_64 fast-forward
thunk that wraps the actual ARM64-native DllMain. Calling DllMain at
that address directly executes x86_64 bytes as ARM64 instructions,
faulting immediately.

Apply arm64ec_redirect_ptr to the EntryPoint after computing it so
Wine calls the real ARM64-native DllMain. Mirrors the same redirect
applied to imported function pointers in import_dll.

After this, kernelbase + kernel32 DllMains run to RETURN 1 cleanly
during the ARM64EC dependency walk.

(cherry picked from commit b06e11567d5b177e5d7185e266f69f73e3f27a9f)
Madeira-commit: ca9a759f1ab10ae40c3b70b937fcb5222a4099c9
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 dlls/ntdll/loader.c | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index 4dba3d010f9..f7bce0d23b7 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -1603,7 +1603,19 @@ static WINE_MODREF *alloc_module( HMODULE hModule, const UNICODE_STRING *nt_name
         if (nt->FileHeader.Characteristics & IMAGE_FILE_DLL)
             wm->ldr.Flags |= LDR_IMAGE_IS_DLL;
         if (nt->OptionalHeader.AddressOfEntryPoint)
+        {
             wm->ldr.EntryPoint = (char *)hModule + nt->OptionalHeader.AddressOfEntryPoint;
+#ifdef __arm64ec__
+            /* For ARM64EC PEs, AddressOfEntryPoint can point into .hexpthk
+             * (x86_64 fast-forward thunks). Redirect to the ARM64-native
+             * target so we don't execute x86_64 bytes as ARM64. */
+            {
+                const IMAGE_ARM64EC_METADATA *metadata = arm64ec_get_module_metadata( hModule );
+                if (metadata)
+                    wm->ldr.EntryPoint = arm64ec_redirect_ptr( hModule, wm->ldr.EntryPoint, metadata );
+            }
+#endif
+        }
     }
 
     InsertTailList(&NtCurrentTeb()->Peb->LdrData->InLoadOrderModuleList,
